<title>USA: So. Hackensack Twp., N.J., won by First Union.</title>
<headline>So. Hackensack Twp., N.J., won by First Union.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union said it won $1 million of South Hackensack Twp., N.J., tax appeal refunding bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.95 percent, highest price of 100.023.</p>
</text>
